OL,3,GNEWSATeen taken to parties with
OL,4,Apoliticians, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former councillor accused of sexually
OL,7,Fassaulting a teenage boy took him to
OL,8,F"private parties" attended by other
OL,9,Flocal politicians, a court has heard.
OL,11,FRylan Ray, 26, a former member of
OL,12,FPeterborough City Council, has denied
OL,13,F25 sexual offences, including one count
OL,14,Fof rape, four of causing or inciting a
OL,15,Fchild to engage in sexual activity and
OL,16,Fthree of making indecent images of
OL,17,Fchildren.
