OL,3,GNEWSATeen taken to parties with
OL,4,Apoliticians, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FIpswich Crown Court was played a police
OL,7,Finterview with a man who alleged Ray,
OL,8,Ffrom Westgate, Peterborough, touched
OL,9,Fhim inappropriately without consent
OL,10,Fwhen he was a teenager.
OL,12,FIn a statement read by prosecutor Lidia
OL,13,FIancu, the man's mum described Ray as
OL,14,Fbeing "well spoken and had his head
OL,15,Fswitched on".
